      "post_id": "2098730339765977137",
      "url": "https://x.com/Tobielobba/status/2098730339765977137",
      "text": "I ordered some things from Temu since August was supposed to have been delivered last week.\n\nthe number they gave me to call for the delivery has been switched off.\n\nI contacted Speedaf. They reassigned it to another person.\n\nThat number? Switched off too and I have complained three times now.\n\nAt this point, I’m no longer even interested in the things I ordered. \n\nI’m just praying they don’t bother delivering it anymore so they can refund my money.\n\nMy eyes are clear and I want my money back 😭",
      "original_text": "I ordered some things from Temu since August was supposed to have been delivered last week.\n\nthe number they gave me to call for the delivery has been switched off.\n\nI contacted Speedaf. They reassigned it to another person.\n\nThat number? Switched off too and I have complained three times now.\n\nAt this point, I’m no longer even interested in the things I ordered. \n\nI’m just praying they don’t bother delivering it anymore so they can refund my money.\n\nMy eyes are clear and I want my money back 😭",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "我从 Temu 订了一些东西，从 8 月起就说本该上周送达。\n\n他们给我的用于配送的联系电话已经关机了。\n\n我联系了 Speedaf。他们把它重新分配给了另一个人。\n\n那个号码呢？也关机了，而我现在已经投诉了三次。\n\n到这个地步，我甚至已经对我订的东西不感兴趣了。\n\n我只是在祈祷他们别再费心配送了，这样他们就可以退我的钱。\n\n我现在清醒了，我想要回我的钱 😭",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "summary_zh": "用户讨论退款进度、支付或售后处理问题。",
