      "post_id": "2098801024127394247",
      "url": "https://x.com/Tobielobba/status/2098801024127394247",
      "text": "Temu (@shoptemu) just sent me an email saying the courier couldn’t reach my number.\n\nMy phone has been on, my number has been working and I have been the one calling every single number they assigned to me since Tuesday, but it has been switched off.\n\nThey reassigned the delivery to another person. Same thing. Switched off.\n\nSo now you’re telling me the courier @Officialspeedaf couldn’t reach me?\n\nI honestly think nobody even called my number in the first place. Someone just keeps reporting “customer’s number is not reachable” and moving on with their life.\n\nThere is NOTHING wrong with my number and this is not the first time I'm buying something from Temu.",
      "original_text": "Temu (@shoptemu) just sent me an email saying the courier couldn’t reach my number.\n\nMy phone has been on, my number has been working and I have been the one calling every single number they assigned to me since Tuesday, but it has been switched off.\n\nThey reassigned the delivery to another person. Same thing. Switched off.\n\nSo now you’re telling me the courier @Officialspeedaf couldn’t reach me?\n\nI honestly think nobody even called my number in the first place. Someone just keeps reporting “customer’s number is not reachable” and moving on with their life.\n\nThere is NOTHING wrong with my number and this is not the first time I'm buying something from Temu.",
      "links": [],
      "translation_zh": "Temu (@shoptemu) 刚给我发了一封邮件，说快递员联系不上我的号码。\n\n我的手机一直开着，我的号码一直能用，而且从周二开始，我一直是那个在拨打他们分配给我的每一个号码的人，但那些号码一直关机。\n\n他们把配送重新分配给了另一个人。还是一样。关机。\n\n所以现在你告诉我快递员 @Officialspeedaf 联系不上我？\n\n老实说，我觉得一开始根本就没人打过我的号码。只是有人一直在上报“客户号码无法接通”，然后继续过自己的日子。\n\n我的号码完全没有问题，而且这也不是我第一次在 Temu 买东西。",
      "translation_status": "translated",
